{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/634520-owod-battle-royale","id":634520,"title":"oWoD Battle royale","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-21T06:21:58-07:00","id":634520,"title":"oWoD Battle royale","content":"IF the three main settings supernaturals (Vampire, Mage and Werewolf) would unite with their kind and fight agains the others, which one you believe would prevail?<br /> Let's pretend they can use any kind of way to do that (direct fight, manipulation, etc.), and they don't want to destroy the planet (let's say everybody wants to rule the world). They don't care for masquerade, veil or anything anymore.<br /> I can see vampires blood bonding/embracing the shit out of everyone. And mages doing crazy things. I believe the garou might fall behind.<br /> <br /> Oh and let's consider 2 cases:<br /> 1- Just people who are active on earth (no ante, archmages, etc.)<br /> 2- Everybody!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3153-lord-revan","name":"Lord Revan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3153_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T08:03:57-07:00","id":634606,"title":"","content":"With prep time, Mages. If you just drop them into a football stadium and have them go at it with no preparation whatsoever, Werewolves. And it would be gory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T09:05:21-07:00","id":634670,"title":"","content":"Yep. With prep time (Which includes making Wonders), Mages. With instant-action, Shifters.<br /> <br /> The Vampires get shafted either way in that 3-way, unless you go the Archmage/Antedeluvian route.<br /> <br /> Then it would be prep time: Mages, instant-action: Vampires.<br /> <br /> Probably. With Archmages and discarded tools, it might very well end up as Mages, period.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":6606,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","user":"Ambrosia","date":". 08-21-2015, 12:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":